{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swing, fling, and cause chaos with your shoes in this physics-based mayhem. Discover secrets, unlock bonus levels, customize your look, and fill your journal with shiny stickers. Master the perfect throw and SHOE IT ALL!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/Steam_Description_Gif_1.gif?t=1747595539\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GET READY TO SHOE IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the unique swing-based aiming mechanic that challenges your precision and timing. Each throw sends your shoes flying into destructible environments where chain reactions spark wild destruction and hilarious surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/Steam_Description_Gif_2.gif?t=1747595539\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COLLECT IT ALL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect shiny stickers, unlock secret and bonus levels, and complete your journal filled with all your wildest shoe-flinging moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/Steam_Description_Gif_3.gif?t=1747595539\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STYLE YOUR CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look with loads of cool accessories and outfits. Tune into a punky tracklist that sets the perfect mood for your chaos-filled adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/extras/Steam_Description_Image_T.png?t=1747595539\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2978860?t=1747595539","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978860/2d20ca238d729df25f184c22984